  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingMarketValueOfSecuritiesReceivedAsCollateralFromCounterpartiesSECTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　３　担保等として差入を受けた有価証券の時価等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingMarketValueOfSecuritiesReceivedAsCollateralFromCounterpartiesSECTextBlock>
